      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "={{ { model: $(\"When Executed by Another Workflow\").item.json.model, think: $(\"When Executed by Another Workflow\").item.json.think, stream: false, format: $(\"Step 1 contract\").item.json.schema, options: { temperature: 0, seed: 42, num_ctx: 8192, num_predict: 4096 }, messages: [{ role: \"system\", content: $(\"Prompt\").item.json.prompt }, { role: \"user\", content: $(\"When Executed by Another Workflow\").item.json.request }] } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Ollama /api/chat body. The contract file is sent as `format`, so the model is held to the schema the check uses. Fixed options for a repeatable answer (R5); num_ctx must match evals/benchmark.py NUM_CTX."
    },
